g","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","review_id":"wZecteXKwov2Vy7npmMptg","date":"2019-02-18T04:53:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9424117803573608,"text_excerpt":"What a cute place! Visited here after working in the city for a couple days. I walked from my hotel and thought it would be a great place to try. I was able to get in before happy hour was over. The appetizer with queso, guac and salso was super good and only $5! Our servers were great and super knowledgeable. Drink specials were the icing on the cake. I believe the fish tacos had grilled red snapper and mango salsa. I thoroughly enjoyed them!"},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","review_id":"_WS4qzZrevH_NSHnpQa9_Q","date":"2011-02-21T19:31:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9278432130813599,"text_excerpt":"Let me start by saying that I like Lucy's for the food, not the bar. I have hung out in the bar waiting for my table, but never I have I been just to have a drink. But, I would like to note that they have killer margaritas. The food is good for what it is. I have only had a few thing on the menu, but I enjoyed them. The turkey burger and fries were awesome! Put avocado on anything and I'm a fan. and the fries were perfect; hot and crunchy. They also have a really great wrap that my girlfriend always gets. One other thing that I like is that its dog friendly. I have yet to take my dog, but I hear the servers are very nice to four legged friends. Bowls of water and even dog hamburgers! When..."},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","review_id":"IgOqvaUb7PlxmlbDnd6iVw","date":"2012-10-23T22:35:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9276653528213501,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I stayed with a friend who literally lives across the street from this place on our trip to New Orleans. This place has a laid back, neighborhood feel to it. It seems to get a college crowd on the weekends, but overall I think this place is awesome. We arrived late at night and stopped here for dinner. Although the bar was packed, we were seated quickly and the food was quite good. The \"chips\" on the appetizer menu are actually pieces of friend catfish - who knew?! The breading is seasoned and the tartar sauce has a unique flavor to it. Definitely our favorite part of the meal. Later on in the week, we stopped by with our dog during their Yappy Hour (every Thursday from 5-7..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","photo_id":"z8zcVjuTs_BrMpjDFtLF3A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/z8zcVjuTs_BrMpjDFtLF3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8546340465545654},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","photo_id":"_ATVErL429Pk_EvhjYf_Vw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_ATVErL429Pk_EvhjYf_Vw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8286520838737488},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","photo_id":"FyCCq9XA3kuIV12clcRhmQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FyCCq9XA3kuIV12clcRhmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283651471138},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","photo_id":"hghZD6trH7T2r0YMpfx85Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hghZD6trH7T2r0YMpfx85Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8209984302520752},{"business_id":"oLc7k78_YcDMnMCdbC-h1A","photo_id":"2T1Mh6i_VCi4N_m-mz7HYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2T1Mh6i_VCi4N_m-mz7HYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7408262491226196}]},"notebook_case":null}
